spec.text:
{
  "id": "T-300",
  "milestone": "M2",
  "depends_on": ["T-299"],
  "title": "A Claude round starts no matter how many past rounds are kept, because its read rules no longer grow with the run folders",
  "public_title": "Start Claude rounds however many past runs exist",
  "scope": [
    "bin/adapters/**",
    "bin/lib/**",
    "tests/**",
    "design/tasks/T-300.json"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "Why. Since T-298 let a round read its own pinned and local-tests folders, the Claude adapter writes one deny rule for every other folder under `state/runs/` (about 2,700 today, about 5,900 rules) and passes the list twice on the command line. The arguments now exceed the macOS limit, so every Claude round fails to start (\"Argument list too long\") and falls back to the other vendor, and the list grows with every round. Building the list also takes about a minute.",
    "What. A Claude round starts, and its argument size does not grow with the number of past run folders. The rules stay as strict as today: the round reads its own worktree, its own pinned and local-tests folders, the prototype only where T-298 and T-299 allow it, and no other part of `state/`.",
    "Done, tests. With several thousand run folders present, a Claude round launch stays under the argument limit and starts (`adapter: many runs still start`, fail-first). A round still cannot read another run's folder or other `state/` paths (`adapter: other runs unreadable`). The existing round-read tests still pass."
  ],
  "explain": {
    "en": {
      "intent": [
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "A Claude round starts however many past runs exist."},
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "A round still reads only its own folders."}
      ],
      "why": [
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "The read rules list every past run, so the command line is too long and every Claude round fails."}
      ],
      "scope_in": ["the Claude adapter", "tests"],
      "scope_out": ["what a round may read"],
      "done": [
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "Intent 1: a test starts a round with thousands of past runs."},
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "Intent 2: a test shows other runs stay unreadable."}
      ],
      "notes": [
        {"kind": "note", "text": "Until this merges, the other vendor runs every worker round."}
      ],
      "before_nodes": [
        {"state": "same", "label": "Build the read rules"},
        {"state": "gone", "label": "One rule per past run"},
        {"state": "same", "label": "Start the round"}
      ],
      "after_nodes": [
        {"state": "same", "label": "Build the read rules"},
        {"state": "new", "label": "Fixed-size rules"},
        {"state": "same", "label": "Start the round"}
      ]
    },
    "zh-TW": {
      "intent": [
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "不論留了多少舊 run，Claude round 都能啟動。"},
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "round 仍然只讀得到自己的目錄。"}
      ],
      "why": [
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "讀取規則列出每個舊 run，命令列太長，每個 Claude round 都起不來。"}
      ],
      "scope_in": ["Claude adapter", "測試"],
      "scope_out": ["round 可讀的範圍"],
      "done": [
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "意圖 1：測試在有幾千個舊 run 時啟動 round。"},
        {"kind": "fact", "text": "意圖 2：測試證明其他 run 仍然讀不到。"}
      ],
      "notes": [
        {"kind": "note", "text": "合併前，每個 worker round 都由另一家 vendor 代跑。"}
      ],
      "before_nodes": [
        {"state": "same", "label": "產生讀取規則"},
        {"state": "gone", "label": "每個舊 run 一條規則"},
        {"state": "same", "label": "啟動 round"}
      ],
      "after_nodes": [
        {"state": "same", "label": "產生讀取規則"},
        {"state": "new", "label": "固定大小的規則"},
        {"state": "same", "label": "啟動 round"}
      ]
    }
  }
}
